    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: FulfillmentStepDefinition records with FulfillmentStepDefinitionGroupId null.
Why it matters: Steps without a group can&apos;t be sequenced in orchestration — provisioning flows skip them silently. Customer experience: order activates but the step never executes.
Suppress a finding: never; assign a group.
Disable the detector: leave on if orchestration is used.</value></values>
